### User Management API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1
@email = admin@ishine.com

### Get user by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Get user by email
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/email/{{email}}

### Get all active users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/active

### Get users by role (STUDENT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/role/STUDENT

### Get users by role (PARENT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/role/PARENT

### Get users by role (TEACHER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/role/TEACHER

### Get users by role (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/role/ADMIN

### Get active users by role (STUDENT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/role/STUDENT/active

### Update user profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Name",
  "email": "updated@example.com"
}

### Change password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "admin123",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### Deactivate user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Reactivate user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/reactivate

### Get all users (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

